# Jmix Entity Rules (Cursor)

## Scope
Applies to `src/main/java/**/entity/`

## Patterns
- `@JmixEntity` + `@Entity`
- ID: `UUID @JmixGeneratedValue`
- `@Version` required
- `@InstanceName` on display field
- No Lombok

## Relationships
- `@ManyToOne(fetch = LAZY) @JoinColumn(...)`
- `@OneToMany(mappedBy = "...")`
- Composition: `@Composition @OnDelete(DeletePolicy.CASCADE)`

## Validation
- Use `@NotNull`, `@Email`, `@Size`, etc.

## Liquibase
- Create changelog in `.../liquibase/changelog/`
- UUID PK, VERSION column
- Add include to `changelog.xml`
- Add messages to `messages_en.properties`

## Forbidden
- Lombok (`@Data`, etc.)
- Field `@Autowired`
- `@GeneratedValue` (use `@JmixGeneratedValue`)
